[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11340.59, "timestamp": "03:09:00", "text": "我们等着老板涨工资"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11350.99, "timestamp": "03:09:10", "text": "[掌声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11354.429, "timestamp": "03:09:14", "text": "猜测。你好。我们等老板"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11356.429, "timestamp": "03:09:16", "text": "再生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.55, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "呃，1分钟。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11362.95, "timestamp": "03:09:22", "text": "所以需要60个，对吧？多少"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11371.59, "timestamp": "03:09:31", "text": "它？我这就睡觉。二。所以是三，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11374.79, "timestamp": "03:09:34", "text": "四、五、六。等待。三，四，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11377.71, "timestamp": "03:09:37", "text": "五，六。还有四个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11383.83, "timestamp": "03:09:43", "text": "但上升之后，我敢肯定还有路要走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11385.71, "timestamp": "03:09:45", "text": "有更多事情要做，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11389.55, "timestamp": "03:09:49", "text": "男人。这些呢？呃，武器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11395.75, "timestamp": "03:09:55", "text": "那么我可能需要做这些。不，这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11396.91, "timestamp": "03:09:56", "text": "就像武器一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11398.429, "timestamp": "03:09:58", "text": "[音乐]"}]